        "content": "## 4.2 Why Components?\nLarge applications may contain thousands of lines of code. Without components:\n- Difficult to maintain\n- Code duplication\n- Hard debugging\n- Low reusability\nWith components:\n- Better organization\n- Code reusability\n- Easy maintenance\n- Faster development",
