        "title": "6.11 Best Practices",
        "type": "reading",
        "courseId": "react-js-complete-course",
        "content": "## 6.11 Best Practices\n- Keep State minimal.\n- Avoid duplicate State.\n- Never modify State directly.\n- Use descriptive State names.\n- Split unrelated data into separate State variables.\n- Use functional updates when the next State depends on the previous State.",
        "order": 11,
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-15T05:59:00.017Z",
        "id": "react-unit-6-11",
