        "courseId": "react-js-complete-course",
        "content": "## 7.10 Form Submission\n> 🚀 **Example:** import { useState } from \"react\"; function Login() { const [name, setName] = useState(\"\"); function handleSubmit(e) { e.preventDefault(); alert(name); } return ( <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}> <input value={name} onChange={(e)=>setName(e.target.value)} /> <button> Submit </button> </form> );\n}",
