        "moduleId": "react-mod-7",
        "title": "7.13 Best Practices",
        "type": "reading",
        "courseId": "react-js-complete-course",
        "content": "## 7.13 Best Practices\n- Use Controlled Components.\n- Prevent unnecessary page reloads using preventDefault().\n- Validate user input.\n- Keep forms simple.\n- Display meaningful error messages.\n- Avoid unnecessary re-renders.",
