        "readingContent": "## 10.7 Navigation using useNavigate\nReact Router provides the useNavigate Hook for programmatic navigation.\n> 🚀 **Example:** import { useNavigate } from \"react-router-dom\"; function Login(){ const navigate = useNavigate(); function handleLogin(){ navigate(\"/dashboard\"); } }"
